## How We Work

#### Discover → Design → Decide & Implement

**Ongoing stewardship:** Quarterly check-ins, rules-based rebalancing, tax-aware optimizations, annual “values & plan” review.

### 30-Day Onboarding

-   Discover (Week 1)
    
    Goals, values, obligations, current holdings, constraints, time horizon.
    
-   Design (Week 2-3)
    
    Investment policy & portfolio blueprint (risk guardrails, asset mix, tax placement, rebalancing rules)
    
-   Decide & Implement (Week 4)
    
    Discretionary onboarding, account transfers, initial allocations, reporting setup.
    

## Trust & Transparency

-   Transparent fees (no product sales agenda)
    

-   Documented decisions & reporting rhythm
    

-   Independent & fiduciary-minded
    
-   Third-party custody & clear statements
    

As a registered Portfolio Manager, we have a fiduciary duty to act in our clients’ best interests.

We charge a transparent advisory fee based on assets under management. We do not receive commissions or trailer fees from product manufacturers.
